      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LOVISA (2) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 1.75 lengths into second (34.39) at this track in a Grade 5 over 595m. Can measure up this time. RADAR O'REILLY (5) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only half a length from Bernardo's Queen in second (30.33) at The Meadows. Form from his last run is proving strong. Must be included in calculations. APPLE ROSE (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 34.70 beating Opalite. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Likely to be in the finish. TIGER ROCKS (8) did a good job to finish third last time out over 595m at this track (34.85) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
